# Trivy ignore list.
#
# The production backend image is slimmed to production dependencies only
# (see Dockerfile.backend, `runtime-deps` stage) and no longer ships build/test
# tooling or the Node base image's bundled npm. Both the backend and frontend
# runtime images currently scan clean at HIGH/CRITICAL, so no CVEs are ignored.
#
# If a new HIGH/CRITICAL finding appears, prefer to fix it by upgrading the
# offending dependency or slimming it out of the runtime image rather than
# adding it here.
